 ## Operating characteristics
 
 ### Time and Memory Complexity
--   **Time:** The decoding process is $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of Gaussians, involving simple arithmetic operations (exp, sigmoid, normalization). It is negligible compared to the transformer forward pass.
--   **Memory:** The method does not introduce significant additional memory overhead beyond storing the raw output tokens and the decoded parameters.
